@title Add PLC card on a new project: the message says where the channels come from, the overview stays below the menu bar
@area Journeys
# Acceptance round 2: Add card drew nothing and said nothing; the PLC overview opened over the menu names.
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text add plc card
wait 6
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Add card"
wait 20
expect "Added card"
expect "To PLC"
shot card-added
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text plc overview
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
expect "PLC overview"
expect "-K1"
shot overview-below-menu
check_layout
# The Pages panel hint is painted text (not in the widget tree); the picture shows it wrapped, not cut at the left edge.
key Escape
try click_text Pages #1
wait 8
shot pages-hint
# A-10: an empty Cabinet workspace offers the way out (the new cabinet form), not only a sentence.
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
expect "No panel yet"
expect_enabled "New cabinet..."
shot cabinet-empty-offer
click_text "New cabinet..."
wait 10
shot cabinet-form
key Enter
wait 20
expect_not "No panel yet"
shot cabinet-created
check_layout
